        "4002": {"synopsis":"Builds the new block: makes its segment the caller's page 1 (USR_P1), links it into the list\nafter the link at HL (LINK_NODE_AT), and fills its descriptor from the bottom of the link\ndown: a\nzero byte, the key from $BF85, the one-segment size, the total size, the gap, and the\ndevice's descriptor pointer from $BF86-$BF88. Clears $BF89: the open has its buffer.","comment":"Carry: no descriptor is built"},
        "4004": {"comment":"USR_P1 = the new block's segment"},
