        "4249": {"comment":"End of the list?"},
        "4250": {"comment":"Yes: the EXOS boundary rises"},
        "4277": {"synopsis":"Works out the node's new place: the destination address and, from EXOS's segment list ($ABD0\ndown), the destination segment."},
